# i18n, text, theme

Locales: **en**, **ar**, **fr**. Arabic must work RTL (`Directionality` via `MaterialApp`).

## Strings

- No user-visible hardcoded English (or any language) in widgets
- ARB per app: `lib/l10n/app_en.arb` (template), `app_ar.arb`, `app_fr.arb`
- Access via generated `AppLocalizations`
- Add the same key to all three ARB files in the same change

## Theme & type

- One `ThemeData` (light + dark) in `lib/core/theme/`
- Text styles only from `TextTheme` / named `AppTextStyles` — never ad-hoc `TextStyle` in screens
- Colors from `ColorScheme` / `AppColors` — no raw `Colors.blue` in features
- Spacing from a small token set (`AppSpacing`)

When a visual language already exists in that app, extend it. Do not invent a second theme.
